1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Measure an AI writing assistant. Go. Start with tasks, not metrics.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:13,930
Define the tasks: emails, summaries, rewrites. Build an eval set from real drafts for each. Offline, score accuracy and tone with a rubric. Online, track how much text users keep, edit or retry. Plan for made-up facts and wrong tone. Close with the one metric you’d watch every release.

3
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:20,730
Interviewers listen for quality split by task, tracking how much text users keep, and naming made-up facts as a risk. The red flag: only saying thumbs-up rate.

4
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:25,730
Tasks first. Then the metrics. Save this for your AI PM interview.
